{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A twist on the cooking simulator genre, with an arcade touch. Become the ultimate multitasking machine, and achieve your high score! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score attack!!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pass, sauteing, grilling, boiling, roasting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom dishes/menu customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Online Multiplayer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UltraCook has been developed with both the lone chefs and great teams in mind. Team up with your friends, set your stations, try each others custom menus. Or go it solo as a lone Chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your time and multitask!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_2.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It can get busy, so be prepared to multitask and perform under the pressure. Keep track of tickets and make sure all your dishes are ready to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find your station...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_3.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find what station suits you, or do them all solo! You can work the pass and boss people around, work the grill, or be a maestro on the pans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make your own menus!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_5.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get creative and make your own custom menus! Play them with friends and see how much the diners like it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't forget to stock up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_4.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock up on fresh ingredients before the busy service starts!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870610?t=1740169463","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870610?t=1740169463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/0e89dc28654372d61cc4675524e065b50ce5d5e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740169463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/0e89dc28654372d61cc4675524e065b50ce5d5e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740169463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A twist on the cooking simulator genre, with an arcade touch. Become the ultimate multitasking machine, and achieve your high score! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score attack!!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pass, sauteing, grilling, boiling, roasting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom dishes/menu customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Singleplayer &amp; Multiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Singleplayer &amp; Online Multiplayer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UltraCook has been developed with both the lone chefs and great teams in mind. Team up with your friends, set your stations, try each others custom menus. Or go it solo as a lone Chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage your time and multitask!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_2.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It can get busy, so be prepared to multitask and perform under the pressure. Keep track of tickets and make sure all your dishes are ready to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find your station...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_3.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find what station suits you, or do them all solo! You can work the pass and boss people around, work the grill, or be a maestro on the pans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make your own menus!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_5.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get creative and make your own custom menus! Play them with friends and see how much the diners like it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Don't forget to stock up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/extras/ultracook_4.gif?t=1740169463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock up on fresh ingredients before the busy service starts!</p>","developers":["RAINPROXY"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870610/header.jpg?t=1740169463","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099018,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099018/movie480.mp4?t=1739719796","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099018/movie_max.mp4?t=1739719796"},"name":"UltraCook - Let's cook!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099018/133eb9fb0b7628c7586a7f16e75a8f6c7a3799cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739719796","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099018/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739719796","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099018/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739719796"}}],"name":"UltraCook","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"UltraCook - $6.99 USD","packageid":1023745,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":699}],"title":"Buy UltraCook"}],"packages":[1023745],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</